      "path": "/projects/ionic-angular-photo-editor/docs/photo-file",
      "html": "<p data-line=\"0\" class=\"code-line\">カメラまたはアルバムから写真を読み込みます。<a href=\"/ja/projects/ionic-angular-photo-editor/docs/readme#%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB\">インストール</a> のあとで呼び出します。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code class=\"code-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> { PhotoFileService } </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> '@rdlabo/ionic-angular-photo-editor'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> AppComponent</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\"> photoFileService</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(PhotoFileService);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.photoFileService.photoMaxSize </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.photoFileService.labels </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      camera: </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'Camera'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      album: </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'Album'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      cancel: </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'Cancel'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> upload</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> files</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">.photoFileService.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">loadPhoto</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (files.</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#a0aab5\">      // upload files</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"%E3%82%AA%E3%83%97%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3\" data-line=\"26\" class=\"code-line\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#%E3%82%AA%E3%83%97%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> オプション</h4>\n<h5 data-line=\"28\" class=\"code-line\">photoMaxSize</h5>\n<p data-line=\"30\" class=\"code-line\">写真の最大サイズです。デフォルトは 1000 です。</p>\n<h5 data-line=\"32\" class=\"code-line\">labels</h5>\n<p data-line=\"34\" class=\"code-line\">設定すると、ラベルが上書きされます。</p>\n",
